From 02bffe9d102a8a276bef8abf1cc473b6a86a1760 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Frantisek Sumsal <frantisek@sumsal.cz>
Date: Fri, 6 Mar 2026 17:58:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fuzz: add a fuzzer for user records

Add a simple fuzzer that verifies our machinery for parsing user records
from JSON works as intended.

The initial corpus was created with the help of Claude, so we have a
bunch of valid user records with as much fields as possible for the
initial corpus.

(cherry picked from commit be0db50cadadb35fdbc117ed68e133f34604b97b)

Related: RHEL-155021
